   "widgets_values": [
    "Create an anime-style illustration of the same character. <image1> shows her whole figure and drawing style. <image2> is a reference sheet of her head from four angles: use it for her face and hair, but draw her only once. Keep her sharp narrow face, sharp chin, narrow green eyes with heavy upper eyelids, thin straight eyebrows, small nose drawn with a single shadow, thin small mouth, very long straight sandy blonde hair, long side-swept bangs and large silver hoop earrings. Copy the drawing style of the references exactly: flat color fills without gradients, hard-edged shadows with rough dry-brush edges, thin dark brown lineart that fades in places, a limited muted palette of beige, olive and black. The background is drawn in the same flat simplified style with few details. No frame or border, one single image with one character. She sits at a table in a modern coffee shop holding a coffee cup, wearing a fully covering oversized beige knit sweater with a high collar and long sleeves. Upper body, afternoon light. A soft natural smile, relaxed eyebrows, looking to the side.",
    "",
    1024
